# W180 (2026-11-25 01:50–01:52Z): one-command clean-archive replay of the
# W175/W177 real-API stack-frame disclosure. Author replay, NOT a witness
# verdict. No camlib or harness source changed by this replay.

## Command (from repository root)

  git archive HEAD reports/frontier-libgphoto2shell.md lab/frontier/libgphoto2shell \
    | tar x -C /tmp/w180-clean-lgp2
  cd /tmp/w180-clean-lgp2
  TARBALL=$REPO/lab/frontier/libgphoto2shell/src/libgphoto2-2.5.34.tar.bz2 \
    WORK=/tmp/w180-final sh lab/frontier/libgphoto2shell/live/replay-real-w177.sh

